      "id": "delivery-david",
      "speaker": "David",
      "voice": "am_puck",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "text": "I have brought provisions from Bethlehem for my brothers.",
      "duration": 2.88,
      "sha256": "81777432b59af854b794c821f6470e3fd34101292b7d7a7ddd2d60387ab64ee2"
    },
    {
      "id": "delivery-keeper",
      "speaker": "Baggage keeper",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "text": "Leave them here, young shepherd. I will keep them safe.",
      "duration": 3.7546666666666666,
      "sha256": "0e6ca399a144667a6281d7dd3448d1560adfbc821220f3844aec22cc415bd509"
    },
    {
      "id": "directions-david",
      "speaker": "David",
      "voice": "am_puck",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "text": "Thank you. Where can I find my brothers?",
      "duration": 2.112,
      "sha256": "0fc4cffda2aa649d2765aa1704c6007279ed262affee0721264b80d11f1dbfb3"
    },
    {
      "id": "directions-keeper",
      "speaker": "Baggage keeper",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "text": "By the line beyond the tents. Follow the path, and stay clear of the ranks.",
      "duration": 4.842666666666666,
      "sha256": "83ddc774367181190016c303233a2e8dce9e59dfdef001d83f6664742987242a"
    },
    {
      "id": "greeting-eliab",
      "speaker": "Eliab",
      "voice": "am_michael",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "text": "David? Who is tending the sheep at home?",
      "duration": 2.496,
      "sha256": "f77f9c720ef5e8c031cc510d84fb0851fefaf8d9b08b7a7ba01d71ffbd80b5f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "greeting-david",
      "speaker": "David",
      "voice": "am_puck",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "text": "They are in safe hands. Our father sent food, and asked me to see how you are.",
      "duration": 4.672,
      "sha256": "aed74903e1bd058f9b75fea9d570187e4adbbc260039dccba887b08305bfba84"
    },
    {
      "id": "answer-eliab",
      "speaker": "Eliab",
      "voice": "am_michael",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "text": "We are well. Stay close. The camp is waiting for the champion's next challenge.",
      "duration": 5.12,
      "sha256": "9660212753b8974e14f491abb9d47eb66c320212eccef4adc7e87dbfd03c3504"
    },
    {
      "id": "answer-david",
      "speaker": "David",
      "voice": "am_puck",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "text": "Then I will listen.",
      "duration": 1.1306666666666667,
